Emotions assignment.
Creating a shape using code was initially difficult to comprehend, that too to convey an emotion felt too big a task. The emotion I was trying to take on was "disgust". The initial idea was to create a gluey substance in the center of the canvas and parts of the same substance extending from all four sides of the canvas. But that seemed too difficult because making arcs was taking too much time. Then came the idea of suffocation and disgust. Why not show disgust through suffocation. Two eyes, one smaller than the other, a greeney creature with pimples all over it. That design shaped into the emotion assignment that was completed on day one.
